# Delete Player Account & Data

This page explains how to delete your **player account** and any **associated data** for **<YOUR GAME NAME>**.

If you delete the app, you can still use this page to understand how deletion works and how to request help.

---

## Delete your account in the game (recommended)

1. Open **Chef's Bubble Feast**
2. Go to **Settings**
3. Select **Delete Player Account**
4. Confirm the deletion prompt

After confirmation, the game will start the deletion process for your account and associated data.

---

## What data is deleted

When you use **Settings → Delete Player Account**, we delete:

- Your in-game player account identifier (used to sign you in)
- Your game profile data associated with that account (for example: progress, save data, inventory, settings)  
  *(Only include items your game actually stores.)*

