## Trouble deleting in-app?

If you can’t access the game (for example, you uninstalled it or the device is unavailable), you can request deletion by contacting us:

- Email: **krazykrakenstudios@gmail.com**
- Subject: **Account deletion request**
- Please include (if possible):
  - Your **Player ID / Account ID** shown in the game (if you still have access)
  - Your device platform (**Android / iOS / PC**)  
  - Approximate last login date

We may ask for additional information to verify the request and protect your account.

